abstract: >-
  Bounded addendum defining the A6 composition transition predicate for
  EXIT, SPLIT, HOLD, and DISSOLVE classification under governed binding.
  The package includes the reviewed Markdown source, academic PDF,
  b-layer review records, and hash-verification records. It supplements
  A6 Composition Layer v0.1.1 and does not replace, silently amend, or
  supersede the parent DOI artifact.
